      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what? Why are you talking about goblins and potions? I'm just trying to do some actual construction math for a real job. Can you just ignore the weird stuff and give me the actual structural specs for the beam size? I need to know the required Moment of Inertia (I) for that deflection limit.",
